Creating a reverb effect for microphone input using Kotlin and JNI (Java Native Interface) involves several steps. Below is an example that outlines how to set this up. Note that this example assumes you have a basic understanding of Kotlin, JNI, and audio processing.

### Step 1: Set Up Your Kotlin Project

